---
name: appman-restart
description: Restart an appman-managed dev server. Then block until healthy.
appman-version: {{appman_version}}
generated-at: {{generated_at}}
---

Run: `appman restart $1`

Then: `appman wait $1 --until healthy --timeout 60s`. On timeout, call `appman errors $1 --structured` and `appman why $1`.
